  JAX implementation of :func:`numpy.dsplit`.

  Refer to the documentation of :func:`jax.numpy.split` for details. ``dsplit`` is
  equivalent to ``split`` with ``axis=2``.

  Examples:

    >>> x = jnp.arange(12).reshape(3, 1, 4)
    >>> print(x)
    [[[ 0  1  2  3]]
    <BLANKLINE>
     [[ 4  5  6  7]]
    <BLANKLINE>
     [[ 8  9 10 11]]]
    >>> x1, x2 = jnp.dsplit(x, 2)
    >>> print(x1)
    [[[0 1]]
    <BLANKLINE>
     [[4 5]]
    <BLANKLINE>
     [[8 9]]]
    >>> print(x2)
    [[[ 2  3]]
    <BLANKLINE>
     [[ 6  7]]
    <BLANKLINE>
     [[10 11]]]

